{
  "title": "Dynamics Concept Map",
  "notes": [
    "- Dynamics (forces & motion)",
    "  - Newton's laws",
    "    - F_net = ma",
    "    - F_AB = −F_BA",
    "    - Inertia (mass)",
    "  - Momentum",
    "    - p = mv",
    "    - Conservation: Σp constant",
    "    - Recoil, rockets, collisions",
    "  - Impulse",
    "    - J = FΔt = Δp",
    "    - Crumple zones / airbags",
    "  - Torque & equilibrium",
    "    - τ = F·d",
    "    - ΣF = 0, Στ = 0",
    "    - Couples, levers, seesaw",
    "  - Friction (solid)",
    "    - f_s = μsN (static, limiting)",
    "    - f_k = μkN (kinetic)",
    "    - Independent of area; μs > μk",
    "    - Angle of repose tanθ = μ"
  ]
}